verdict rule (self-referencing): the n=1 row IS the isolated chain cost. pure MAC for the chain = 42M MAC -> ~320 cyc full-width, ~640 at 0.5 util. If marginal -> a few hundred cyc (~pure MAC), fill amortizes and the plan holds; if marginal stays near the n=1 cost, fill is exposed per tile and the composed estimate doubles+.
